    "abstract": "Parts figure for the crew mask regulator installation at one flight crew station, showing the supply hose in both standards, the regulator manifold and the stowage guide bracket.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the crew mask regulator installation at one flight crew station, with the supply hose, the manifold at the regulator outlet and the stowage arrangement.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the first officer station; the captain station is a mirror image and uses the same part numbers. Items 10 and 10A are the supply hose standards: the sleeved hose at item 10 is longer at the regulator end and must be used with the guide bracket. The obsolete manifold at item 20A is no longer supplied and any removal must be replaced by item 20."
    },
